{"title":"Menorah","slug":"Menorah","hero":{"file":"Menorah.webp","width":400,"height":575},"pageid":1966,"revid":16317,"timestamp":"2024-12-08T04:57:42Z","lastEditor":"AEUNOR","categories":["Items","Interactive_Items","Decorative_Item","Event_Items"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay Island"},{"label":"Shop","value":"Santa's Workshop"},{"label":"Price","value":"5,600 Snowflakes"},{"label":"Function","value":"Decoration"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"Version 1.71.0"},{"label":"optional Title","value":"Menorah"}]},"sections":[{"id":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<p><i><big>\"Illuminate the festival of lights with this symbolic Menorah.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview</h2>\n<p>The <b>Menorah</b> is a limited Christmas time item that can be found in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Santa's_Workshop/\">Santa's Workshop</a>. It can be purchased for 5,600 snowflakes and is located on the conveyor.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>In the Christmas of 2023, it was sold at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Oak_Depot/\">The Oak Depot</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0cd233e1f56757c9127bc96ed792b64f\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Menorach_in_Oak_Depot-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Menorah in Oak Depot\">Menorah in Oak Depot</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Menorah in Oak Depot\">Menorah in Oak Depot</span></span></div></div><div>Menorah in Oak Depot</div></div></div>"}
